# Normalise to LF everywhere.
#
# This matters more than usual here: assignment6 commits frozen inputs
# (corpus/documents.jsonl, tokenizer/tokenizer.json) and CI re-generates them
# and diffs against the committed copies to prove they are reproducible. If git
# rewrote line endings on checkout, that diff would fail on one platform and
# pass on another, and the "frozen" claim would depend on the OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary payloads.
*.bin   binary
*.pt    binary
*.png   binary
*.npz   binary
*.jpg   binary
